{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"resin_pot","model_identifier":"resin_pot","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## resin_pot\n\nCarried load, made goods.\n\n- Cubes: 8 (1 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.0..3.0, y -9.0..1.0, z -3.0..3.0 (size 6.0 x 10.0 x 6.0 u = 17 x 28 x 17 cm).\nResin pot: a clay pot of amber pitch (~18 cm) with a stirring stick standing in it and a drip down the side, carried by a cord bail through the fist. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 9.0.\n"},"description":"## resin_pot\n\nCarried load, made goods.\n\n- Cubes: 8 (1 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.0..3.0, y -9.0..1.0, z -3.0..3.0 (size 6.0 x 10.0 x 6.0 u = 17 x 28 x 17 cm).\nResin pot: a clay pot of amber pitch (~18 cm) with a stirring stick standing in it and a drip down the side, carried by a cord bail through the fist. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 9.0.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"pot","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.5,-9.0,-2.5],"to":[2.5,-4.0,2.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[12,0,17.0,5.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[17,0,22.0,5.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[22,0,27.0,5.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[27,0,32.0,5.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,7,5.0,12.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[5,7,10.0,12.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"f54f5bc3-a489-5eea-bce7-db2e1ac1a7d3"},{"name":"belly","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":